Articles, linking verbs, "you", "please", "note that" and "instead" in text only an agent reads.
-- hit/agent-compact --
Run the gate before push.
Cache is stale after edit.
You run gate first.
Please read captured log.
Note that gate reruns.
Use refs instead of grep.
-- pass/agent-compact --
Run gate before push.
Cache stale after edit -> rerun.
Read captured log; never rerun to see more.
Use refs, not grep.
Call is_valid before commit.
